{
  "Name": "HP OpenView NNM nnmRptConfig nameParams Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability in HP NNM's nnmRptConfig.exe. A remote user can send a long string data to the nameParams parameter via a POST request, which causes an overflow on the stack when function ov.sprintf_new() is used, and gain arbitrary code execution.'",
